    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 153.057, 282.72, 186.931 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The explicit expressions are lengthy and so are represented graphically in Fig.(1) for some average parameters of a Kerr-Newman black hole."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 44,
