    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 22.62, 282.721, 70.522 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "After an inﬁnitesimal proper time dτ, the particle moves in the 3-axis by an amount, δφ = uϕdτ. Over this the momentum in the local inertial frame transforms under the LLT, Λab (x) ="
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
