    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "δab + λab (x)dτ, which corresponds to a unitary operator that acts on the state of the particle."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 47,
